fline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Zarturael/", "num_games_owned": 296, "num_reviews": 158, "playtime_forever": 678, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 615, "last_played": 1735496789, "avatar": "d708a62a346cdb44903900bf318a6b55014fca54"}, "language": "english", "review": "I expected a good game, yet I still got surprised with how extremely fun to play this is. You get to kill tons of Orks and Chaos forces in a spectacular and bloody fashion, no matter if you prefer to do it from a distance with the interesting arsenal of different guns at your disposal, or prefer to get up close and shred your enemies to pieces with the chainsword, power axe or thunder hammer. But in the end, you can go out there and annihilate xenos and heretics in the name of your glorious Emperor, so what other reason could you possibly need? 👑👊", "timestamp_created": 1663148410, "timestamp_updated": 1663148410, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122179138", "author": {"steamid": "76561198365046184", "personaname": "Wölfysnepp 🐾", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Wolfysnepp/", "num_games_owned": 988, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 802, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 802, "last_played": 1705672869, "avatar": "6f672da3bd2cb002fe3edbbf10de6edbd73d83a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best examples of a game in the Warhammer franchise. You play as the warrior of Adeptus Astartes, who kills all enemies encountered on his way with the use of extensive arsenal of weapons. All this is accompanied by epic cinematics and colorful special effects. The story campaign is not very long, but will not let you get bored.\nIn addition to everything, the game has multiplayer with various game modes. And it is very balanced, you can easily beat players with a level much higher than yours. You can be either a Loyalist or a Chaosite. But I hope you understand that the online is not too high", "timestamp_created": 1663066401, "timestamp_updated": 1740494840, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "122155228", "author": {"steamid": "76561199120303083", "personaname": "BigBobbyBasher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199120303083/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1491, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 943, "last_played": 1785598749, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great", "timestamp_created": 1663012440, "timestamp_updated": 1663012440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}